sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant A0 as Owner
participant A1 as FastAPI
participant A2 as PG / Jobs
participant A3 as Object Store
participant A4 as Worker
participant A5 as Qdrant
participant A6 as Neo4j
Note over A0,A6: Writes staged in both indexes. Readers see only PG active_index_run_id.
A0 ->> A1: 1 POST PDF + ACL
A1 ->> A2: 2 draft version + PENDING job
A1 ->> A3: 3 save immutable PDF
A1 -->> A0: 4 document_id + job_id
A4 ->> A2: 5 lease job (SKIP LOCKED)
A2 -->> A4: 6 version + checksum
A4 ->> A3: 7 load PDF; OCR / chunk
A3 -->> A4: 8 page text + source IDs
A4 ->> A5: 9 stage vectors(run_id)
A4 ->> A6: 10 stage scoped graph(run_id)
A4 ->> A5: 11 verify counts / provenance
A4 ->> A6: 12 verify edges / provenance
A4 ->> A2: 13 atomic publish pointer
A2 -->> A4: 14 READY or error
Note over A0,A6: Failure → FAILED / capped retry; last READY run is unchanged.
